{"code":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23522","section":"Austria","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=EBXRmV31dciUjWLUGKYlAg&viewpoint=47.803271946364575%2C13.080062000772974&heading=61.151281510618205&pitch=7.432257762597132","text":"Dashed lines, person is wearing a hat.","countryCodes":["AT"],"sourceTagId":"23522","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-d7f1586f430029bef9d9.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23523","section":"Belgium","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=5xyy6seOonOTZrnRJcqlJg&viewpoint=51.020392020695795%2C4.557410628372784&heading=143.20196238563628&pitch=1.0474584926145951","text":"Dashed lines, person looks boxy.","countryCodes":["BE"],"sourceTagId":"23523","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-71ca4bb1afb8046962f0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23524","section":"5 stripes, belt, rounded shoes","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Cx5HcAMEX7-WgBiq1Na5Ng&viewpoint=41.17738237760174%2C20.676024784338413&heading=28.73931756083408&pitch=8.874217083668029","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a belt and has rounded shoes.","countryCodes":["BA"],"sourceTagId":"23524","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-051a1e5d0783d0c4b0ea.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23525","section":"Bulgaria","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=u5fa4v9F2AwRyQP-aYzE3g&viewpoint=42.708596877324226%2C23.299755116176325&heading=61.331024169921875&pitch=5.634372234344482","text":"4 zebra stripes, person is wearing a hat.","countryCodes":["BG"],"sourceTagId":"23525","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-d7f406bdd3e9fb6f4527.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23527","section":"Czechia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=OnILwDrP46hBVxZIgfwOQQ&viewpoint=50.01634012164566%2C14.442824857160414&heading=45.954580583011946&pitch=-0.8560067513182616","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a hat and well detailed. Slovakia uses a similar design, but in Czechia there will be less distance between zebra lines and the white triangle border.","countryCodes":["CZ"],"sourceTagId":"23527","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-ecde12bfa54b8affc6fd.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23528","section":"Denmark","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=cRrSyaslCR8vS65O-MeFiQ&viewpoint=55.68063697010668%2C12.57118768833342&heading=136.81&pitch=29.0","text":"5 zebra stripes touching the blue background, person looks kinda \"shy\". These are most normal for Denmark and Faroe Islands, but sometimes can be found in Iceland as well.","countryCodes":["DK"],"sourceTagId":"23528","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-5794a84d3fd3920eaf88.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23529","section":"Estonia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=JV4P_SN1VtxCke8CdfyAAg&viewpoint=59.398997947444734%2C27.28654095296664&heading=206.77&pitch=0.9300000000000068","text":"3 zebra stripes, person is well detailed.","countryCodes":["EE"],"sourceTagId":"23529","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-9efda07fdf1cf2450588.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23530","section":"Finland","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=roM29siNtjwl6Ccf64EstA&viewpoint=60.457153584632735%2C22.26740729459514&heading=67.96827233160995&pitch=2.6862630761205963","text":"Finland has 2 designs - 5 zebra stripes, person is well detailed and has boxy shoes. - 5 zebra stripes, person is not well detailed, has round shoes and looks somewhat \"shy\" 5 stripes: Finland Sweden (4 stripes)","countryCodes":["FI"],"sourceTagId":"23530","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-e92aadf467c7f32f4010.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23531","section":"France, Romania","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=wvlpVRg9LKxg5X5bvcr_Dw&viewpoint=43.617972544724%2C1.4366874736906081&heading=37.713714599609375&pitch=-0.19662979245185852","text":"5 zebra stripes, person's arms and legs are all bent at least a bit, none of them are straight. Romania sometimes uses a very similar design, but France has a white border on the sign, while Romania usually uses yellow or none, although white border can still be seen sometimes.","countryCodes":["FR"],"sourceTagId":"23531","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-7bcaa6c4a44e9f22fe59.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23532","section":"5 stripes, belt, pointed shoes","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Q54t0PN-pdJkFVL9vV5eBw&viewpoint=42.661830556953106%2C20.2953747641042&heading=82.37716300616431&pitch=5.137031714183053","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a belt, pointed shoes. Very similar design is found in Hungary, but in this variant the part of the bent arm that's closer to the person's body has a sharp end, while in Hungary it will be sharp on the other side of the hand.","countryCodes":["DE"],"sourceTagId":"23532","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-54297738f4ddc8c0729e.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23533","section":"Greece","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=cHMhz0HWDZR-EM_8yjsFPw&viewpoint=39.63460500972817%2C22.429851845622547&heading=140.16723187484055&pitch=17.889183060821395","text":"Dashed lines, person is well detailed and has noticeable fists.","countryCodes":["GR"],"sourceTagId":"23533","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-318609705f3d8634fe8c.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23534","section":"Hungary","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=sFaj9jZwUXB1cKx3leNevg&viewpoint=46.899723615155374%2C19.689231651624137&heading=245.7068593319025&pitch=1.1635734146674537","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a belt, pointed shoes. Very similar design is found in Germany, but in this variant the part of the bent arm that's farther from the person's body has a sharp end, while in Germany it will be sharp on the other side of the hand.","countryCodes":["HU"],"sourceTagId":"23534","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-c725505a7c019cf52e37.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23535","section":"Iceland","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=N3UoT5IdPjziV_zLDb1AFA&viewpoint=64.11366637191648%2C-21.92492536227189&heading=137.2351029055149&pitch=9.541723608797042","text":"Yellow triangle instead of white.","countryCodes":["IS"],"sourceTagId":"23535","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-e3d44f8aaa5b7010cdca.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23536","section":"5 stripes, no belt, 45° angle","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=XqbEU-fImvLabhjt5NcpcA&viewpoint=46.53736627891945%2C24.55749662429081&heading=166.22120950511905&pitch=-3.509215833238571","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is not well detailed and has no belt, his right hand is bent at approximately a 45° angle, while all other body parts are straight. Turkey uses the same design, but it will feature an off-center white triangle placed near the bottom.","countryCodes":["IT"],"sourceTagId":"23536","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-00b4387c39ff4d00c528.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23537","section":"Latvia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=lk29us4YFsjjiKxb0v7UzQ&viewpoint=56.49280912448544%2C25.87176990742917&heading=50.31744225340136&pitch=-1.144261342043734","text":"5 zebra stripes, person has long legs.","countryCodes":["LV"],"sourceTagId":"23537","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-009f5a4fd32cadaf63f0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23539","section":"Netherlands","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=7-Bjyu7DZG88JOXabQKNmw&viewpoint=51.84486800747562%2C5.868455560514487&heading=253.87&pitch=16.370000000000005","text":"5 zebra stripes, \"drunk\" boxy person with hands and legs pointed in different directions.","countryCodes":["NL"],"sourceTagId":"23539","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-3390c827240c30666107.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23540","section":"Norway","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=ZDQ6lCRQ3p-5O3HMHhZahg&viewpoint=59.90772403201594%2C10.771883468382397&heading=148.89515842774523&pitch=5.510594622876823","text":"Norway has different designs, it uses 4-5 zebra stripes and different types of person, but the main thing is that all the signs will have a metal border which covers half of the sign.","countryCodes":["NO"],"sourceTagId":"23540","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-0e25a3d8b3cf96357863.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23541","section":"Poland","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=PnfmSolwskjSuNplVDxM2w&viewpoint=51.10132040238918%2C17.03954088705659&heading=139.15&pitch=0.15000000000000568","text":"One long horizontal line behind the person.","countryCodes":["PL"],"sourceTagId":"23541","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-d4344faa186fa6e9802b.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23542","section":"Portugal","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=BMftBmUUJErAgrJr9dsieA&viewpoint=41.53926839844611%2C-8.433692637773664&heading=219.18632164739435&pitch=-2.691495167446604","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a belt which is noticeably higher than in other countries.","countryCodes":["PT"],"sourceTagId":"23542","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-b734e170ed057dfc0c22.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23544","section":"3 stripes, not detailed","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=uMiJP2y18Wh70qDr6bCGlQ&viewpoint=55.072871759504416%2C24.279556527110635&heading=75.63510225168125&pitch=2.0185786610167895","text":"3 zebra stripes. The person is not well detailed.","countryCodes":["RU"],"sourceTagId":"23544","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-5b722283f00ace564e87.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23546","section":"Slovakia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-VaG-SfxHSRE8FJD7EIxtg&viewpoint=48.31091345784999%2C18.07313415642116&heading=281.47512157868005&pitch=-0.8332116292838663","text":"5 zebra stripes, person is wearing a hat and well detailed. Czechia uses a similar design, but in Slovakia there will be a big distance between zebra lines and the white triangle border.","countryCodes":["SK"],"sourceTagId":"23546","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-9df55fb1f8cbe23c33a0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23548","section":"Spain, Andorra","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=FUN-V0zOtUCkfIKpWgrmuw&viewpoint=41.52100415531517%2C0.33812180794817287&heading=97.23469163130972&pitch=-0.2647789401309808","text":"8 zebra stripes.","countryCodes":["ES"],"sourceTagId":"23548","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-7dfd0f52a75782e5acd9.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-23549","section":"Sweden","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=GbxwWz8wycS4SGEpPR5GEA&viewpoint=58.586521625653724%2C16.19727585306978&heading=182.83&pitch=4.8799999999999955","text":"4 zebra stripes, person is well detailed and has boxy shoes 4 stripes: Finland (5 stripes) Sweden (4 stripes)","countryCodes":["SE"],"sourceTagId":"23549","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-e676c81106a88586cad0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-80244","section":"Dashed stripes, fat person","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=GcJc-_M6MwFB8xbRuBiKZw&viewpoint=44.814972932228514%2C20.49229989968301&heading=319.46&pitch=-1.6800000000000068","text":"Dashed stripes, person is noticeably more fat than in other countries, that also use dashed stripes.","countryCodes":["RS"],"sourceTagId":"80244","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-bb5718f903db0d6fd6e0.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-80245","section":"Switzerland, Liechtenstein","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=RfH_1IbX5Fej3__pRhRyXw&viewpoint=47.14075192959038%2C9.520993422149957&heading=316.0596070329056&pitch=6.316989082764408","text":"Rectangular sign with 7 zebrastripes.","countryCodes":["CH"],"sourceTagId":"80245","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-8d612993811ab95c780a.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-pedestrian-signs-80246","section":"Slovenia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=8C5JXR1mHzfrW9uL6RkHyg&viewpoint=46.08818321461691%2C14.50792557154953&heading=16.77584191619966&pitch=-0.09599159149372838","text":"Dashed lines, very uniquely bent back hand.","countryCodes":["SI"],"sourceTagId":"80246","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-fbcf0caa8599666cb8e7.avif"}]}